 ## Background
-SegAnySplatting Feature Optimization is part of the `gaussian-splatting-lightning` repository by yzslab [S1, unofficial]. It extends 3D Gaussian Splatting to support semantic feature optimization, building on the Appearance Model and visibility map concepts from earlier sections [S1, unofficial]. The method is designed to work with datasets like MipNeRF360 and PhotoTourism [S1, unofficial].
